}

### 6.8. Validation: Amount = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/debts/{{debtId}}/payments
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0,
  "payment_date": "2026-06-01"
}

### 6.9. Validation: Amount âm
POST {{baseUrl}}/debts/{{debtId}}/payments
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -1000000,
  "payment_date": "2026-06-01"
}

### 6.10. Validation: Principal + Interest != Amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/debts/{{debtId}}/payments
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 11000000,
  "principal_paid": 8000000,
  "interest_paid": 2000000,
  "payment_date": "2026-06-01"
}

